  "translation": "The weather last Sunday was very good. My older sister and I went to the park together. There were flowers and chairs in the park, very beautiful. My sister asked me what time in the morning we would leave, and I said eight o'clock. We set off from home and took the bus. In the park, we saw many children. Some were running, some were dancing. A child asked us what our names were, and we told him. We walked for a while, then sat on the chairs to rest. My sister said she wanted to drink water, but the shop had no water, only milk tea and coffee. I can drink milk tea, and my sister can drink coffee. My sister asked how much the milk tea cost, and I said one cup was two yuan. We drank while walking. At noon, we went to a small restaurant to eat. I ate dumplings, and my sister ate noodles. The dumplings were delicious, and my sister said her noodles were also not bad. After eating, we went to the bookstore. I bought a Chinese book, and my sister bought a notebook. In the afternoon, we went home. Mom made dinner, and we three ate together as a family. In the evening, I watched a movie and then slept. This Sunday was really happy."
